    "“%@”及其所有页面将被删除，此操作无法撤销。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” and all its pages will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」とすべてのページを削除します。この操作は取り消せません。"
